  i A test doesn't need to return a value. Test runners only make use of a returned promise, by waiting for it, and await makes that waiting easier to see.
  
  i Remove the return statement. If it returns a promise, mark the test function as async and use await on the promise instead.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

